WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A materials decision balances performance, mass, cost, safety, process and repairability. No material is best in every context.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Create a weighted decision table and mark each score as evidence, estimate or assumption.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Evidence matrix

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A material category is not a guarantee of strength, durability or safety. Processing and test conditions matter.

